  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1125.04 Financial Audits. The department’s office of business management shall audit all state and federal special education monies allocated to any public or private agency by the department.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
